# daniel_pauls_quest_one — "Help Daniel Pauls"
#
# Granted by Councillor Mosley's hand-in (mosley_vape_quest_one.quest, node nag_two) when the
# player returns his vape. A bridging quest: walk back to Daniel Pauls, who is stood outside the
# Cellar exit where you first met him, and hear him out. Its real job is to hand over the next
# Daniel Pauls quest.
#
# GIVER is Councillor Mosley because he is who hands this out; the quest is named for who it sends
# you to. Change it if the journal should read the other way round.
#
# ⚠ STAGE IS MANUAL, NOT TALKTO — deliberate.
# A TalkTo stage completes on the interact, BEFORE any dialogue choice is picked, so a choice
# gated on this quest being active would race the completion and behave differently on the first
# open than on every one after. Manual hands control to the dialogue: a choice carrying
# COMPLETE: daniel_pauls_quest_one is what ends it, and that is also the natural place for Daniel
# to grant whatever comes next.
#
# ⚠ NO DIALOGUE BLOCK HERE, DELIBERATELY.
# quests/spark_of_talent.quest owns Daniel Pauls' entire conversation. Only one file may declare
# DIALOGUE danielpauls: each import regenerates Dialogue_danielpauls.asset wholesale, so a second
# declaration would silently clobber the first depending on file order.
#
# Daniel's lines for THIS quest go in spark_of_talent.quest as nodes reached by a choice on his
# NODE start carrying  GATE: active daniel_pauls_quest_one  — and the COMPLETE: for this quest
# lives on a choice in those nodes.
#
# Preset_DanielPauls.QuestKey must be set to "danielpauls" in the Inspector. It is not read by
# this quest any more (Manual watches nothing), but it is what any future TALKTO/KILL stage keyed
# on him would bind to, and it costs nothing to set now.

QUEST daniel_pauls_quest_one
TITLE: Help Daniel Pauls
GIVER: Councillor Mosley
LOCATION: London, Cellar Entrance.

STAGE MANUAL
OBJECTIVE: Chat with Daniel Pauls again.

# No payout: this is a bridge, and the payoff is the quest Daniel hands over at the end of it.
REWARD
POUNDS: 0
XP: 0
